{"kind":"FETCH","data":{"headers":{},"body":"{\"posts\":[{\"id\":14756,\"date\":\"2026-05-10T10:29:16+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-10T08:29:18+00:00\",\"slug\":\"airpods-max-2-509-amazon-tutti-colori\",\"title\":\"AirPods Max 2 a 499 euro su Amazon in 4 colori\",\"excerpt\":\"Su Amazon è disponibile AirPods Max 2 a 509 dollari in tutte le cinque colorazioni, in calo da 549 dollari. Consegna prevista intorno al 11 maggio.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/airpods-max-2-purple-768x432.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"airpods-max-2-purple\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14697,\"date\":\"2026-05-08T09:00:22+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-08T06:35:38+00:00\",\"slug\":\"airpods-pro-fotocamere-ai-test-advanced-2\",\"title\":\"AirPods Pro con fotocamere AI: test “advanced” in corso\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Bloomberg, gli AirPods Pro con fotocamere integrate sono in fase di test “advanced”: design e feature set quasi definitivi, con possibile avvio della produzione iniziale.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/airpods-pro-3-orange-768x432.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"airpods-pro-3-orange\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14695,\"date\":\"2026-05-08T08:35:12+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-08T06:35:12+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-wearable-tipo-airtag-fotocamere-integrazione-iphone\",\"title\":\"Apple lavora a un wearable “tipo AirTag” con fotocamere e integrazione iPhone\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Mark Gurman (Bloomberg), Apple continua lo sviluppo di un accessorio “pendant con fotocamere” e di smart glasses con integrazione iPhone.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/Second-Generation-AirTag-Feature-Purple-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Second-Generation-AirTag-Feature-Purple\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14645,\"date\":\"2026-05-06T16:30:04+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-05-06T07:09:31+00:00\",\"slug\":\"openai-accelerera-phone-agenti-ai-produzione-1h27\",\"title\":\"OpenAI accelera il “phone” con agenti AI: produzione nel 1H27\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Ming-Chi Kuo, OpenAI starebbe accelerando lo sviluppo del suo primo “AI agent phone”, puntando alla produzione di massa già nella prima metà del 2027.\",\"categoryName\":\"Intelligenza Artificiale\",\"categorySlug\":\"intelligenza-artificiale\",\"categoryId\":188,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/05/openai-logo-neon-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"openai-logo-neon\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14471,\"date\":\"2026-04-28T00:37:42+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-27T22:37:42+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-due-nuovi-prodotti-ultra\",\"title\":\"Apple: in arrivo due nuovi prodotti “Ultra”\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Macworld, Apple pianifica di lanciare un “iPhone Ultra” pieghevole e un “MacBook Ultra” con display OLED e touchscreen nel prossimo anno.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/Apple-Logo-Black-768x429.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Logo-Black\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14443,\"date\":\"2026-04-25T12:32:52+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-25T10:32:52+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-macbook-ultra-fino-a-sei-nuove-funzioni\",\"title\":\"Apple “MacBook Ultra”: fino a sei nuove funzioni in arrivo\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Bloomberg, Apple starebbe preparando un grande redesign per i MacBook Pro di fascia alta, con possibile branding “MacBook Ultra” e fino a sei nuove funzioni: OLED, touch, Dynamic Island, chip M6 Pro/M6 Max, design più sottile e connettività cellulare.\",\"categoryName\":\"Mac\",\"categorySlug\":\"mac\",\"categoryId\":12,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/MacBook-Pro-Low-Angle-Wide-Lens-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"MacBook-Pro-Low-Angle-Wide-Lens\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":0,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14378,\"date\":\"2026-04-24T09:10:53+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-24T07:10:53+00:00\",\"slug\":\"nuovi-airpods-pro-videocamere-ir-2026\",\"title\":\"Nuovi AirPods Pro con videocamere IR: cosa aspettarsi nel 2026\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo indiscrezioni, Apple starebbe lavorando a una nuova variante degli AirPods Pro con piccole videocamere a infrarossi. Possibili novità su gesti, audio spaziale con Vision Pro, chip H3 e prezzi.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/airpods-pro-3-glitter-blue-768x432.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"airpods-pro-3-glitter-blue\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14257,\"date\":\"2026-04-14T08:12:37+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-14T06:12:37+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-testa-quattro-modelli-smart-glasses-materiali-fascia-alta\",\"title\":\"Apple testa quattro modelli di smart glasses con materiali di fascia alta\",\"excerpt\":\"Secondo Mark Gurman (Bloomberg), Apple sta sviluppando almeno quattro stili di smart glasses in acetato, con integrazione stretta a iPhone e Siri e rilascio previsto tra fine 2026 e 2027.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/Apple-Glasses-Blue-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple-Glasses-Blue-Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":2,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14237,\"date\":\"2026-04-14T08:11:19+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-14T06:11:19+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-seconda-beta-ios-26-5-ipados-26-5\",\"title\":\"Apple rilascia la seconda beta di iOS 26.5 e iPadOS 26.5\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha distribuito agli sviluppatori la seconda beta di iOS 26.5 e iPadOS 26.5 per test. Le novità includono aggiornamenti su Maps, RCS e funzioni per wearables in UE.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/iOS-26.5-Glass-Feature-Warm-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"iOS-26.5-Glass-Feature-Warm\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14112,\"date\":\"2026-04-02T13:27:00+02:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-04-02T11:27:00+00:00\",\"slug\":\"airpods-max-2-disponibili-da-oggi-negozi-apple\",\"title\":\"AirPods Max 2 disponibili da oggi nei negozi Apple\",\"excerpt\":\"Da oggi gli AirPods Max 2 sono acquistabili in molti Apple Store nel mondo, con disponibilità di ritiro in giornata e prime consegne avviate.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/04/AirPods-Max-2-Lifestyle-Shot-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"AirPods-Max-2-Lifestyle-Shot\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":4,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":14006,\"date\":\"2026-03-24T19:42:37+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-03-24T18:42:37+00:00\",\"slug\":\"watchos-26-4-disponibile-aggiornamento-workout-emoji\",\"title\":\"watchOS 26.4 disponibile: aggiornamento workout ed emoji\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha rilasciato watchOS 26.4 con supporto AirPods Max 2, avvio più rapido degli allenamenti e 8 nuove emoji.\",\"categoryName\":\"Watch\",\"categorySlug\":\"watch\",\"categoryId\":186,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/03/watchos-26-gradient-light-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"watchos gradient light\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":3,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":13984,\"date\":\"2026-03-22T20:59:23+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-03-22T20:37:34+00:00\",\"slug\":\"nuova-apple-tv-homepod-mini-pronti-lancio\",\"title\":\"Nuova Apple TV e HomePod Mini Pronti per il Lancio\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple ha presentato nove nuovi prodotti questo mese, ma l'attesa continua per i modelli di Apple TV 4K e HomePod mini di nuova generazione.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/03/HomePod-mini-and-Apple-TV-Sage-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"HomePod mini and Apple TV Sage\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":13972,\"date\":\"2026-03-21T18:19:42+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-03-21T17:20:46+00:00\",\"slug\":\"migliori-offerte-apple-settimana-airpods-pro-3\",\"title\":\"Le Migliori Offerte Apple della Settimana: AirPods Pro 3 a 208,00 €, Prezzo Più Basso su Amazon\",\"excerpt\":\"Questa settimana, le offerte Apple includono il ritorno del prezzo più basso di sempre per gli AirPods Pro 3, Apple Watch Series 11 e sconti sui nuovi prodotti Apple.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/03/Best-Apple-Deals-Feature-Shelf-0004-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Best Apple Deals Feature Shelf\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":1,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":13933,\"date\":\"2026-03-15T02:30:43+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-03-15T12:34:46+00:00\",\"slug\":\"storie-principali-apple-50-anniversario-nuovi-prodotti\",\"title\":\"Storie Principali: Il 50° Anniversario di Apple, Nuovi Prodotti e Novità\",\"excerpt\":\"Dopo una settimana ricca di annunci, Apple ha reso disponibili i nuovi prodotti e ha avviato i preparativi per il 50° anniversario dell'azienda.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/03/top-stories-2026-03-14-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"top stories\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":5,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":13751,\"date\":\"2026-03-08T15:31:46+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-03-08T15:20:53+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-lancio-tre-nuovi-dispositivi-ultra\",\"title\":\"Apple potrebbe lanciare tre nuovi dispositivi 'Ultra' quest'anno\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple prevede di lanciare almeno tre nuovi dispositivi di classe 'Ultra' quest'anno, secondo Mark Gurman di Bloomberg.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/03/Apple-Logo-Black-768x429.jpeg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple Logo Black\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":15,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":13466,\"date\":\"2026-02-26T13:09:07+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-02-28T12:45:42+00:00\",\"slug\":\"airpods-pro-alta-gamma-apple-intelligence\",\"title\":\"Rumor di Lancio di AirPods Pro di Alta Gamma con 'Apple Intelligence' Quest'Anno\",\"excerpt\":\"Si vocifera che Apple preveda di svelare nuovi AirPods Pro quest'anno, una versione di alta gamma degli AirPods Pro 3 lanciati meno di sei mesi fa.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/02/airpods-pro-3-design-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"airpods pro design\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":21,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":13355,\"date\":\"2026-02-19T22:03:30+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-02-21T10:35:10+00:00\",\"slug\":\"meta-rinnova-piani-smartwatch-apple-watch\",\"title\":\"Meta Rinnova i Piani per uno Smartwatch per Competere con Apple Watch\",\"excerpt\":\"Meta è pronta a lanciare il suo primo smartwatch quest'anno, dotato di tracciamento della salute e Meta AI integrato.\",\"categoryName\":\"Tecnologia\",\"categorySlug\":\"tecnologia\",\"categoryId\":5,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/02/Meta-16x9-1-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Meta x\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b40ae840f0d4f1233d56350e82f6a69?s=96&d=mm&r=g\",\"authorSlug\":\"andreaem\",\"viewCount\":38,\"review\":null,\"changelog\":[],\"tldr\":[],\"breaking\":null},{\"id\":13293,\"date\":\"2026-02-17T20:31:01+01:00\",\"modified\":\"2026-02-21T10:31:33+00:00\",\"slug\":\"apple-lavoro-dispositivi-indossabili-ai\",\"title\":\"Apple al lavoro su tre dispositivi indossabili AI: occhiali smart, AI Pin e AirPods con telecamere\",\"excerpt\":\"Apple sta accelerando lo sviluppo di tre dispositivi indossabili AI, tra cui occhiali smart, un pin AI e AirPods, tutti connessi all'iPhone e a una versione avanzata di Siri.\",\"categoryName\":\"Apple\",\"categorySlug\":\"apple\",\"categoryId\":2,\"imageUrl\":\"https://static.techjournal.it/2026/02/Apple-Glasses-Purple-Feature-768x432.jpg\",\"imageAlt\":\"Apple Glasses Purple Feature\",\"authorName\":\"Andrea Emili\",\"authorAvatarUrl\":\"https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/a6d88f7136ceb04a0480684144e0ec339b